  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Taps and use of «te»",
   "texto": [
    "To ask about the size you say «Welke maat zoek je?» (What size are you looking for?). The verb to try out clothes is «passen»: «Wil je deze broek passen?» (Do you want to try this pants?). When a garment does not fit well we use «te» (too much): «hij is te klein» (too small) or «hij is te groot» (too large). Remember that masculine / feminine objects are referred to with «hij»: «de broek... hij is te klein»."
   ]
  },
